{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17142","headline":"省试恩赐耆老布帛 · 李绦","name":"省试恩赐耆老布帛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涣汗中天发，殊私海外存。\n衰颜逢圣代，华发受皇恩。\n烛物明尧日，垂衣辟禹门。\n惜时悲落景，赐帛慰余魂。\n厚泽沾翔泳，微生保子孙。\n盛明今尚齿，欢奉九衢罇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}